---
title: "wl slot と claim の状態遷移"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: done
    lg1: busy
    lg2: work
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 blue
  s0: 空き (準備済)
  s1: begin ロック取得 (base 確認中)
  s2: 準備中 (prepare claim)
  s3: claim 済 (Task 未記録)
  s4: 開始済 (Claimed)
  s5: checkout 準備済
  s6: 作業可能 (Ready)
  s7: 退役処理中 (branch 削除済)
  s8: 退役処理中 (Task 削除済)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: begin が task_lock 取得
  s0 --> s2: prepare_slot が prepare claim 書込
  s2 --> s0: prepare_slot 完了 (claim 解放)
  s1 --> s3: claim 作成
  s3 --> s4: Task(Claimed) 書込
  s4 --> s5: slot checkout 確認
  s5 --> s6: branch 切替と Ready 書込
  s6 --> s7: retire 安全性検査と clean
  s7 --> s8: tasks/t.json 削除
  s8 --> s0: slots/n.claim 削除
  class s0 teal
  class s1 purple
  class s2 purple
  class s3 purple
  class s4 purple
  class s5 purple
  class s6 blue
  class s7 blue
  class s8 purple
